  #line-at(85.544pt, 146.264pt, "As example, in Spain, photovoltaic self-consumption continues to expand and has already ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 162.104pt, "surpassed 9.3 GW of cumulative installed capacity. However, the annual deployment rate ")
