  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(188.342pt, 241.544pt, ". These figures suggest a transition from a phase of rapid expansion ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 257.384pt, "to a more mature market, where maximizing the value of existing installations is ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 273.224pt, "becoming increasingly important and where new approaches are needed to support citizen ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 289.064pt, "participation to local generation and consumption beyond direct subsidies.  ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 319.304pt, "Under these changing conditions, understanding how citizen-led projects can remain ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 335.144pt, "attractive and continue delivering value to their members becomes increasingly relevant. ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 365.384pt, "While significant advances have been made in the design, operation, and optimization of ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 381.224pt, "energy communities, practical solutions tailored to residential and citizen-led initiatives ")
