  #line-at(85.544pt, 162.104pt, "This pattern is also evident in Spain, where the National Observatory of Energy ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 177.944pt, "Communities reported 837 initiatives by the end of 2025. Among them, 70,8 % had fewer ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 193.784pt, "than 50 members, underscoring the prevalence of small-scale, citizen-led models. In most ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 209.624pt, "cases (74% in Spain), their primary activity is collective photovoltaic self-consumption, ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 225.464pt, "reflecting a practical and accessible entry point into community energy participation.")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 7.92pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(493.058pt, 221.384pt, " 19 ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(85.544pt, 255.944pt, "Within this situation a fundamental question emerges: ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "italic", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(390.024pt, 255.944pt, "which operational and ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 271.784pt, "organizational strategies remain available to citizens continue investing in photovoltaic ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 287.624pt, "self-consumption systems? ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(222.076pt, 287.624pt, " The objective of this study is to identify practical and ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 303.464pt, "accessible approaches for citizen-led initiatives capable of improving technical ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 319.304pt, "performance, economic resilience, and long-term sustainability while remaining ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 335.144pt, "manageable for non-expert users. ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 365.144pt, "To investigate this question, the study focuses on the CERCA Energy Community ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 380.984pt, "(Comunidad Energética Renovable de Calatayud), a citizen-led initiative operating across ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 396.824pt, "67 rural municipalities in Aragón, Spain. CERCA currently manages 18 photovoltaic ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 412.664pt, "installations with a combined capacity of 845 kWp under Spain’s collective self-")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 428.504pt, "consumption framework. The analysis is based on real operational and consumption data ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 444.344pt, "from one collective self-consumption facility comprising 24 prosumers. ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 474.344pt, "The paper makes three contributions. ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 504.104pt, "The first contribution establishes a counterfactual benchmark to quantify the value ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 519.944pt, "created by collective coordination. By comparing the observed community arrangement ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 535.784pt, "with a hypothetical scenario of individually operated photovoltaic systems, the analysis ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 551.864pt, "isolates the economic and operational benefits that arise from aggregation and ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 567.704pt, "coordinated energy use. The results offer evidence to support strategies and policies that ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 583.544pt, "can sustain and expand citizen-led photovoltaic initiatives under current market ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 599.384pt, "conditions. ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 629.144pt, "The second contribution focuses on reconducting the agreements on shares allocations ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 644.984pt, "established energy communities. Although numerous studies have proposed dynamic ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 661.064pt, "allocation mechanisms, most have been developed as theoretical optimization exercises ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 676.904pt, "or for newly established communities. ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 7.92pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(277.149pt, 672.824pt, "20-24")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(295.813pt, 676.904pt, " . We also know that this mechanism is not ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 692.744pt, "widely adopted by the DSOs in Europe. By contrast, this study evaluates how alternative ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 708.584pt, "allocation models can be implemented according to the current legal frameworks in ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 724.424pt, "mature communities where investments, governance structures, and participation ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 740.264pt, "agreements are already in place. Attention is given to the trade-offs between technical ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 756.104pt, "performance, fairness, and practical implementation. ")
]

// arXiv source page 6
#original-page(595.276pt, 841.89pt, none)[
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(504.824pt, 804.344pt, "6 ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 82.664pt, "The third contribution examines the economic viability of battery storage integration ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 98.744pt, "under current market conditions. Despite its potential to increase self-consumption and ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 114.584pt, "flexibility, storage deployment remains limited among citizen energy communities. This ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 130.424pt, "study evaluates whether battery investments can generate sufficient value under different ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 146.264pt, "allocation schemes and identifies the conditions under which storage becomes ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 162.104pt, "economically attractive for community-led initiatives. ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 191.864pt, "The results aim to provide actionable guidance for citizens, community managers, and ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 207.944pt, "policymakers seeking to preserve the value of distributed photovoltaic investments under ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 223.784pt, "an increasingly challenging economic environment. ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "bold", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(103.544pt, 254.024pt, "2.")
  #line-at(121.544pt, 254.024pt, "Methodology ")
  #line-at(103.544pt, 269.864pt, "2.1")
  #line-at(122.544pt, 269.864pt, "Research rationale ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(103.544pt, 300.104pt, "The research approach taken in this study operates under a three-step logic. ")
  #line-at(103.544pt, 321.944pt, "To begin with, we aimed to quantify the value created by collective coordination. A ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 337.784pt, "counterfactual scenario was therefore developed in which each household operated an ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 353.624pt, "individual photovoltaic system sized to its annual demand. The resulting technical and ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 369.704pt, "economic performance was compared with that of the existing collective installation, ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 385.544pt, "allowing the benefits derived from aggregation, load diversity, and coordinated operation ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 401.384pt, "to be isolated. This benchmark provides the basis for evaluating the additional value that ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 417.224pt, "can be achieved through alternative allocation schemes and storage integration. ")
  #line-at(103.544pt, 439.064pt, "Next, we investigated whether the technical parameters, i.e. self-consumption ratio ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 454.904pt, "(SCR) or self-sufficiency ratio -SSR-; of the current collective solar plant owned by ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 470.744pt, "CERCA could be enhanced by exploring different energy-sharing models. In Spain, the ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 486.584pt, "immediate dynamic distribution of energy is not technically applied, creating a significant ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 502.424pt, "limitation for optimizing the community's performance.  Therefore, we examined four ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 518.504pt, "practical allocation models that mimic dynamic functions while still adhering to existing ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 534.344pt, "laws.  We evaluated these models based on their efficiency, fairness, and possible effects ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 550.184pt, "on community governance.  ")
  #line-at(103.544pt, 572.024pt, "In the final stage, we analyse the integration of a shared battery into the current ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 587.864pt, "operational setup to assess how the incorporation of storage affects the technical and ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 603.704pt, "financial results for different sharing distribution models.  This third step allowed us to ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 619.544pt, "quantify how the benefits (or drawbacks) of storage influence users with varying ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 635.384pt, "electricity needs, as well as how the selection of the allocation method impacts the ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 651.464pt, "investment's value.  ")
  #line-at(103.544pt, 673.304pt, "All three analytical phases together form a clear framework for not only ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 689.144pt, "understanding the community's present performance but also exploring how much more ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 704.984pt, "effectively it could operate with different strategies for both operations and investments, ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 720.824pt, "creating a practical roadmap to be implemented. ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "bold", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(103.544pt, 751.064pt, "2.2")
  #line-at(122.544pt, 751.064pt, "Data and inputs ")
]

