  #line-at(103.544pt, 98.744pt, "3.2.1")
  #line-at(139.544pt, 98.744pt, "How much it worth it? ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(55.544pt, 98.744pt, "43 ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 128.984pt, "Continuing from the baseline analysis of stand‑alone systems, we next simulated a ")
  #line-at(55.544pt, 128.984pt, "44 ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 144.824pt, "collective scenario in which all households pool their demand and are supplied by a single ")
  #line-at(55.544pt, 144.824pt, "45 ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 160.664pt, "PV plant. Every technical parameter other than scale as module efficiency, orientation, ")
  #line-at(55.544pt, 160.664pt, "46 ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 176.504pt, "hourly load traces, was kept identical to the individual case; the optimisation routine was ")
  #line-at(55.544pt, 176.504pt, "47 ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 192.344pt, "allowed to size the shared array freely. The resulting solution, presented in Table 4, calls ")
  #line-at(55.544pt, 192.344pt, "48 ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 208.184pt, "for a 110.5 kWp installation, about nine per cent smaller than the total 121 kWp that ")
  #line-at(55.544pt, 208.184pt, "49 ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 224.024pt, "would be required if each dwelling pursued self‑consumption on its own. Because bulk ")
  #line-at(55.544pt, 224.024pt, "50 ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 239.864pt, "procurement reduces the specific investment to €750 kWp")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 7.92pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(364.285pt, 235.784pt, "-1")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(370.949pt, 239.864pt, " and the balance‑of‑system is ")
  #line-at(55.544pt, 239.864pt, "51 ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 255.944pt, "consolidated into one site, the collective plant demands an upfront outlay of €82,875 , ")
  #line-at(55.544pt, 255.944pt, "52 ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 271.784pt, "almost forty‑five per cent below the sum of individual investments. That figure is not ")
  #line-at(55.544pt, 271.784pt, "53 ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 287.624pt, "merely theoretical: the real project in Calatayud eventually commissioned 211 standard ")
  #line-at(55.544pt, 287.624pt, "54 ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 303.464pt, "550 W modules (116.05 kWp) with a net cost of €88,039, a number that sits between the ")
  #line-at(55.544pt, 303.464pt, "55 ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 319.304pt, "modelled optimum (201 units) and the aggregate of stand‑alone layouts (242 units). The ")
  #line-at(55.544pt, 319.304pt, "56 ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 335.144pt, "comparison reveals the first tangible advantage of the energy community shared self-")
  #line-at(55.544pt, 335.144pt, "57 ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 350.984pt, "consumption approach: fewer modules and therefore less roof/land area, cabling and ")
  #line-at(55.544pt, 350.984pt, "58 ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 366.824pt, "inverter capacity are needed to serve the same annual demand. ")
  #line-at(55.544pt, 366.824pt, "59 ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 396.824pt, "Operationally, the shared plant generates 176.9 MWh yr⁻¹, covering ninety‑two per cent ")
  #line-at(55.544pt, 396.824pt, "60 ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 412.664pt, "of the community’s total consumption. Load diversity softens instantaneous peaks, so ")
  #line-at(55.544pt, 412.664pt, "61 ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 428.504pt, "only 95 MWh must still be imported from the grid, while 90 MWh are exported when ")
  #line-at(55.544pt, 428.504pt, "62 ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 444.344pt, "midday production exceeds aggregate demand. The higher simultaneity between ")
  #line-at(55.544pt, 444.344pt, "63 ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 460.184pt, "generation and consumption raises on‑site self‑consumption to 49,18%, a clear ")
  #line-at(55.544pt, 460.184pt, "64 ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 476.024pt, "improvement over the 36,2% average obtained under individual operation. Thanks to both ")
  #line-at(55.544pt, 476.024pt, "65 ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 492.104pt, "scale and improved utilisation, the community achieves a levelized cost of electricity of ")
  #line-at(55.544pt, 492.104pt, "66 ")
  #line-at(85.544pt, 507.944pt, "€0.023 kWh")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 7.92pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
